# --- Database Backup Artifacts (P6 Issue 2 / P7 Issue 01) ---
# NEVER commit database dumps or database export artifacts to the repository.
# Backups must be written to BACKUP_DEST_DIR (external storage / secure S3/GCS bucket) only.
# See SECURITY.md for the approved backup workflow.
backups/
backup/
dumps/
*.dump
*.backup
*.bak
*.pgdump
*.sql.gz
*.sql.tar
*.sql.sha256
backup_*.sql
latest_backup_metadata.json
# NOTE: prisma/migrations/**/*.sql is intentionally NOT excluded here.
# Prisma migration files are legitimate schema source artifacts and MUST remain tracked.
# The backups/ directory rule and backup_*.sql patterns cover the actual risk.